{"id":"n62482-1-14","stage":3,"title":"이익 · 利益","scene":"工作与经济","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n62482-1-14-1","ko":"이번에 수영이라도 배워 볼까?","zh":"这次要不要试着学学游泳？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이번에","meaning":"这次，这回","explanation":"이번：这次，这回；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"이번","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29737","senseId":"1","lemma":"이번","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이번에","audio":"/audio/46d83053c21d45a8f49f.mp3"}},{"text":"수영이라도","meaning":"游泳","explanation":"수영：游泳；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；라도：表示让步或假定：“即使是、就算是”。","readings":[{"term":"수영","audio":"/audio/a2fcc3f1c53a37caae9b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64611","senseId":"1","lemma":"수영","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"수영이라도","audio":"/audio/59808976e413af897048.mp3"}},{"text":"배워","meaning":"学，学习","explanation":"배우다：学，学习；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"배우다","audio":"/audio/2c65351237177855703f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62088","senseId":"1","lemma":"배우다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"배워","audio":"/audio/8d1cd9ceb0acf4d27cec.mp3"}},{"text":"볼까?","meaning":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","explanation":"보다：试着做（-아/어 보다）；ㄹ까：非敬语地提出建议、自问或推测：“要不要、会不会”。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62171","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"볼까","audio":"/audio/ac480717af809a867fd7.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"da78d4146f0588e8","term":"이번","zh":"这次，这回","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3","entryId":"29737","definition":"马上到来的顺序；或指刚过去的顺序。","pronunciation":["이번"]},{"id":"a2fcc3f1c53a37ca","term":"수영","zh":"游泳","audio":"/audio/a2fcc3f1c53a37caae9b.mp3","entryId":"64611","definition":"在水中游行。","pronunciation":["수영"]},{"id":"2c65351237177855","term":"배우다","zh":"学，学习","audio":"/audio/2c65351237177855703f.mp3","entryId":"62088","definition":"获得新知识。","pronunciation":["배우다"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62171","definition":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","pronunciation":["보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/70091b5f272ac2d2af3a.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n62482-1-14-2","ko":"원래 뭐든 하나씩 배워 두면 너한테 이익이야.","zh":"反正什么技能学一点总归对你有好处。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"원래","meaning":"原来，本来","explanation":"원래：原来，本来","readings":[{"term":"원래","audio":"/audio/dc5331dd64d187d4a0fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"53768","senseId":"1","lemma":"원래","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"원래","audio":"/audio/dc5331dd64d187d4a0fd.mp3"}},{"text":"뭐든","meaning":"什么","explanation":"뭐：什么；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；든：表示选择；与疑问词合用时可表示“无论、任何”。","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84991","senseId":"2","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뭐든","audio":"/audio/4aebaaf672cdd2977551.mp3"}},{"text":"하나씩","meaning":"一","explanation":"하나：一；씩：名词后缀，构成派生名词。","readings":[{"term":"하나","audio":"/audio/556dcbf069a950eb94f3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20279","senseId":"1","lemma":"하나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하나씩","audio":"/audio/3104aa4b25e408324861.mp3"}},{"text":"배워","meaning":"学，学习","explanation":"배우다：学，学习；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"배우다","audio":"/audio/2c65351237177855703f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62088","senseId":"1","lemma":"배우다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"배워","audio":"/audio/8d1cd9ceb0acf4d27cec.mp3"}},{"text":"두면","meaning":"放任，撇下，搁置","explanation":"두다：放任，撇下，搁置；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"두다","audio":"/audio/531b2c3977c491e8379e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67470","senseId":"16","lemma":"두다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"두면","audio":"/audio/2eacfbaa050f1bbdc9b8.mp3"}},{"text":